A sentinel resolves to the single binding id token when the binding has an id.

  $ cat > a.ml <<EOT
  > [@@@css.bindings [("A.x", "_a0aone _a0btwo", "_iAAAAAAAA")]]
  > EOT

  $ cat > b.ml <<EOT
  > [@@@css.atoms [("_c0aswitch", [".\000A.x\000>*{color:red}"], 0, 0, 1, [])]]
  > [@@@css.refs [("A.x", "b.ml", 1, 0, 5)]]
  > EOT

  $ styled-ppx.generate a.ml b.ml
  /* This file is generated by styled-ppx, do not edit manually */
  ._iAAAAAAAA>*{color:red}
